# AUDITED SMOKE of lever S1 (the shard argmax kernels), run before that lever's timing pair: c2-packed-tp4-best-gate-samp is c2-packed-tp4-best-gate (every verify audit on, the quad, the fused commit and the five
# verify-glue levers with their audits) plus EXACTLY QWEN_FAST_TP4_SHARD_ARGMAX=1 and QWEN_FAST_TP4_SHARD_ARGMAX_AUDIT=1. Today's untilize / argmax / value path runs beside the kernels in every verify capture and every round compares every row of every chip: ids exactly, values as numbers ('[PINDIAG] tp4 shard argmax audit N exact=True'). The T1 audit (the combined ids against the pinned sampler, every row) runs too.
# Tests: warmup, coding, concurrent4 (four users, each compared with its solo run) and concurrent4_code_equal (four real-code prompts of 4k).
# Read: no audit mismatch line anywhere; the engine log shows '[PINDIAG] tp4 shard argmax engaged' and 'shard argmax audit N exact=True' lines and no 'fell back' line; the smoke check passes (it fails an audited arm with no
# passing audit line). A FAIL or a hang here means SKIP the lever's timing pair.
# OPTIONAL: a failure does not stop the window (it decides whether the lever's pair runs). Duration (estimate): 45-90 min.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the four-card tp4/samp-draft window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/samp-draft and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The window's jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-samp-1 is the image B0 builds from the pushed tp4/samp-draft commit while production serves (it carries
# tp4_shard_argmax, tp4_draft_conv and tp4_draft_heads and their kernels, which are new); a later commit needs a new tag in every template.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-samp-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-best-gate-samp
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent4,concurrent4_code_equal
